OL,3,GNEWSAMan repeatedly fixes road damaged
OL,4,Aby burst pipes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 71-year-old man says he has
OL,7,Frepeatedly repaired a track leading to
OL,8,Fhis home after damage caused by burst
OL,9,Fwater pipes.
OL,11,FJames Ovel says visitors and delivery
OL,12,Fvehicles are cut off from his home when
OL,13,Fthe old pipes regularly crack.
OL,15,FHe says he has tried to reinstate the
OL,16,Fpassageway five times in 12 months,
OL,17,Fadding: "To say it's inconvenient is an
OL,18,Funderstatement."
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
